{"5046250":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"BrouHaHa","steam_appid":5046250,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWELVE PLAYERS. ONE VOICE. NO SPELL-CHECK.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrouHaHa is a competitive spelling game for up to 12 players.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice reads a word out loud. That's all you get.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints. No letters on screen. No autocorrect.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type it exactly right before the timer runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone hears the same word at the same moment. Everyone types in silence. Then every answer flips over at once. The fastest correct spellers earn the biggest scores, and the leaderboard reshuffles in front of the whole lobby.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ONE MAY HAVE MANY FACES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/28d55f3114787e08cba00004fccafbf3.avif?t=1793656923\" width=555 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HEARTS, NOT POINTS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score resets at the end of every round. Your hearts don't.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round has three words. When the round ends, the players at the bottom lose a heart while the leaders gain one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your last heart and you're out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a full lobby, the bottom three bleed while the top two heal, so mid-table is never safe and last place is never dead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round also gets tougher. The answer timer drops from 12 seconds toward 6, while your free audio replays shrink from three to none.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SHOP IS WHERE IT GOES WRONG<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every correctly spelled word earns dollars!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every round, spend your money on <strong>100+ hand-drawn coupons<\/strong>. Before every single word, there's a card phase where you play them on whoever is beating you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/2bf4aa270530d24c840252921cfb406e.poster.avif?t=1793656923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/2bf4aa270530d24c840252921cfb406e.webm?t=1793656923\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/2bf4aa270530d24c840252921cfb406e.mp4?t=1793656923\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or keep the cards for yourself instead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy extra seconds, additional replays, score multipliers, the opening letters of the word, or insurance against elimination.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards come in Common, Uncommon, Rare and Legendary rarities, drawn from a weighted shop. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bought a dud? Sell it back for half price.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE IN HAND, TWO ON THE SHELF<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some coupons are never played. They simply sit on your passive shelf and keep working.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have room for two.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others exist for a single dramatic moment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three active cards. Two passive cards. Never enough space.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing what to keep is most of the game.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 12 players online<\/strong> - Quick Play matchmaking or private lobbies with Steam invites.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ coupons <\/strong>across sabotage, self-buffs, economy and pure chaos. Three active slots and two passive slots.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6,000+ words per language<\/strong>, filtered to real, spellable and unambiguous entries. Nothing you can only get right by luck.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word audio in English, German and Spanish<\/strong>. One language per lobby, so everyone hears the same pronunciation.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interface in 10 languages<\/strong> - English, Turkish, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Czech and Portuguese.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectate or leave<\/strong> - Eliminated players can watch the carnage or jump straight into another match. Never held hostage.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWELVE PLAYERS. ONE VOICE. NO SPELL-CHECK.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BrouHaHa is a competitive spelling game for up to 12 players.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice reads a word out loud. That's all you get.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints. No letters on screen. No autocorrect.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type it exactly right before the timer runs out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone hears the same word at the same moment. Everyone types in silence. Then every answer flips over at once. The fastest correct spellers earn the biggest scores, and the leaderboard reshuffles in front of the whole lobby.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ONE MAY HAVE MANY FACES<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/28d55f3114787e08cba00004fccafbf3.avif?t=1793656923\" width=555 height=150 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HEARTS, NOT POINTS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score resets at the end of every round. Your hearts don't.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round has three words. When the round ends, the players at the bottom lose a heart while the leaders gain one.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose your last heart and you're out.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a full lobby, the bottom three bleed while the top two heal, so mid-table is never safe and last place is never dead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round also gets tougher. The answer timer drops from 12 seconds toward 6, while your free audio replays shrink from three to none.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SHOP IS WHERE IT GOES WRONG<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every correctly spelled word earns dollars!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every round, spend your money on <strong>100+ hand-drawn coupons<\/strong>. Before every single word, there's a card phase where you play them on whoever is beating you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/2bf4aa270530d24c840252921cfb406e.poster.avif?t=1793656923\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/2bf4aa270530d24c840252921cfb406e.webm?t=1793656923\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/extras\/2bf4aa270530d24c840252921cfb406e.mp4?t=1793656923\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or keep the cards for yourself instead.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy extra seconds, additional replays, score multipliers, the opening letters of the word, or insurance against elimination.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards come in Common, Uncommon, Rare and Legendary rarities, drawn from a weighted shop. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bought a dud? Sell it back for half price.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE IN HAND, TWO ON THE SHELF<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some coupons are never played. They simply sit on your passive shelf and keep working.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have room for two.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others exist for a single dramatic moment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three active cards. Two passive cards. Never enough space.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing what to keep is most of the game.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 12 players online<\/strong> - Quick Play matchmaking or private lobbies with Steam invites.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ coupons <\/strong>across sabotage, self-buffs, economy and pure chaos. Three active slots and two passive slots.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6,000+ words per language<\/strong>, filtered to real, spellable and unambiguous entries. Nothing you can only get right by luck.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Word audio in English, German and Spanish<\/strong>. One language per lobby, so everyone hears the same pronunciation.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interface in 10 languages<\/strong> - English, Turkish, German, Spanish, French, Italian, Dutch, Polish, Czech and Portuguese.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectate or leave<\/strong> - Eliminated players can watch the carnage or jump straight into another match. Never held hostage.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Hear a word. Type it in 12 seconds. Get it wrong and you fall down a 12-player leaderboard until you're the one eliminated. Buy coupons between words to distort your rivals' audio, scramble their typing, and steal their dollars.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German<strong>*<\/strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*<\/strong>, Czech, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Turkish, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/d8d0f5281ed7d00a237c3a0c9e3f54a32f1afbbb\/header.jpg?t=1793656923","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/2c6f53f0c8452e3286e49a50a6419e04a1928675\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793656923","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5046250\/2c6f53f0c8452e3286e49a50a6419e04a1928675\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793656923","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit (21H1+)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong>  Dual-core 3.0 GHz<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong>  DirectX 11, 1 GB VRAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":[